# The white keys show the selected track's trigs (and the playhead while playing) on the Tonic's sound pages too:
# FX 1st press, SEL, ENV, LFO, EDIT, HOME 1st press. They were dark there (only the black keys lit).
wait 300
tap FX
tap SEQ
expect view 7
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
expect hit0.0.0 1
expect hit0.0.4 1
leds
tap FX
leds
shot ledtrigs_fx1.png
tap SEL
leds
tap ENV
leds
tap LFO
leds
tap EDIT
leds
tap HOME
leds
shot ledtrigs_home1.png
# while playing, the playhead runs over the white keys (the key under it is inverted)
tap FX
tap PLAY
wait 200
leds
wait 200
leds
wait 200
leds
tap PLAY
# the footer of the sound pages names the white keys (wip119)
tap SEL
shot ledtrigs_footer.png
